4. GGUF community quantization
------------------------------
The Q4_K_M file used by default is a community quantization by mradermacher of
the official Chandra OCR 2 weights. Quantization can reduce accuracy compared to
BF16. Verify the SHA-256 printed by `ocr-tool models download` (pinned in
`crates/ocr-app/src/download.rs`).

